// Issue #185, fetta 1e: the utility commands of c_utils (dir, cd, cat) with the old and the new executable.
// The folder of the run has utility.txt and utility.con (copied from Tests\Data\Console); the output goes to
// DATA\LOGS\*_stdout.txt. The web page commands are not here: they open a browser.
printf ---dir
dir utility.txt
dir utility.txt utility.con
ls nomatch
printf ---cd
cd
pwd
printf ---cat
cat utility.txt
type utility.txt utility.txt
cat
type
cat nomatch
printf ---end
